/T (NANSEN has continued to make a difference through its unique combination of individual and structural work, legal and interdisciplinary expertise, and its key position at the intersection of practice, policy and research. We work alongside people in vulnerable situations who seek protection, bringing legal expertise to the challenges they face. This would not be possible without our exceptionally committed and knowledgeable team.)
/E (NANSEN has continued to make a difference through its unique combination of individual and structural work, legal and interdisciplinary expertise, and its key position at the intersection of practice, policy and research. We work alongside people in vulnerable situations who seek protection, bringing legal expertise to the challenges they face. This would not be possible without our exceptionally committed and knowledgeable team.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3]
>>
