/T (At the same time, there was significant change within NANSEN itself. With deep gratitude and appreciation, we said farewell to our director, Julie Lejeune, who for many years put NANSEN firmly on the map through her tireless commitment, expertise and leadership. We are very grateful for everything she has contributed to the organisation.)
/E (At the same time, there was significant change within NANSEN itself. With deep gratitude and appreciation, we said farewell to our director, Julie Lejeune, who for many years put NANSEN firmly on the map through her tireless commitment, expertise and leadership. We are very grateful for everything she has contributed to the organisation.)
/Pg 12 0 R
