/T (A significant new step in 2025: NANSEN held its first-ever dedicated meeting on gender with the Office of the Commissioner General for Refugees and Stateless Persons \(CGRS\) Gender service. We shared our findings on emerging challenges in SOGI-related cases, highlighted barriers and presented our expertise and concrete recommendations. )
/E (A significant new step in 2025: NANSEN held its first-ever dedicated meeting on gender with the Office of the Commissioner General for Refugees and Stateless Persons \(CGRS\) Gender service. We shared our findings on emerging challenges in SOGI-related cases, highlighted barriers and presented our expertise and concrete recommendations. )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
