/P 136 0 R
/E (Without a nationality, stateless people can face serious hurdles in establishing their identity, obtaining documentation, securing residence, or accessing fundamental rights such as work, healthcare, education and family life. The legal and factual questions behind statelessness are often complex, making it hard to even establish that someone is stateless - let alone access protection and basic services. )
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
295 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 136 0 R
/E (The procedures that stateless people need to navigate to establish their status and seek protection in Belgium are complex, lengthy and characterised by structural barriers that can be extremely difficult, if not impossible, to overcome. Throughout its existence, NANSEN has provided specialised legal support to people affected by statelessness, through individual casework, legal analysis, strategic litigation and knowledge-sharing.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
