/T (The complexity of the legal framework also creates a need for accessible and reliable information for practitioners. NANSEN produced a practical guide on statelessness in Belgium, bringing together the legal and practical information practitioners need most. Publication of the guide was put on hold pending the Constitutional Court proceedings, as the outcome could affect the applicable legal framework. While the guide will be updated following the Constitutional Court judgment and any relevant changes to the procedures, NANSEN continues to use the guide in its daily work supporting affected individuals. )
/E (The complexity of the legal framework also creates a need for accessible and reliable information for practitioners. NANSEN produced a practical guide on statelessness in Belgium, bringing together the legal and practical information practitioners need most. Publication of the guide was put on hold pending the Constitutional Court proceedings, as the outcome could affect the applicable legal framework. While the guide will be updated following the Constitutional Court judgment and any relevant changes to the procedures, NANSEN continues to use the guide in its daily work supporting affected individuals. )
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [2]
>>
