/P 137 0 R
/T (Since 2023, troubling emerging practices related to the prevention of statelessness under Article 10 of the Belgian Nationality Code for children born in Belgium have been observed. These developments particularly concerned children born in Belgium to parents of Palestinian origin and, in 2025, resulted in important case law. NANSEN continues to monitor these developments and provides legal support to lawyers and through individual casework. )
/E (Since 2023, troubling emerging practices related to the prevention of statelessness under Article 10 of the Belgian Nationality Code for children born in Belgium have been observed. These developments particularly concerned children born in Belgium to parents of Palestinian origin and, in 2025, resulted in important case law. NANSEN continues to monitor these developments and provides legal support to lawyers and through individual casework. )
