/T (The EU Pact on Migration and Asylum also raises important questions for stateless people. NANSEN analysed its implications for Belgium and put forward concrete recommendations to ensure that statelessness is properly identified and registered. As the Pact is implemented, NANSEN will closely monitor how these safeguards are applied in practice and whether they contribute to stronger protection of stateless people. )
/E (The EU Pact on Migration and Asylum also raises important questions for stateless people. NANSEN analysed its implications for Belgium and put forward concrete recommendations to ensure that statelessness is properly identified and registered. As the Pact is implemented, NANSEN will closely monitor how these safeguards are applied in practice and whether they contribute to stronger protection of stateless people. )
