/E (Moreover, we brought our expertise to the professionals responsible for identifying and assessing torture survivors. We contributed to a training for volunteer doctors carrying out medical examinations in detention. We trained 60 CGRS Protection Officers on the Istanbul Protocol and how to read detailed medical reports, giving us direct access to decision-makers who determine whether and how medical reports and evidence are used in making decisions on international protection.)
