/E (In 2024, NANSEN launched a Proof Your Social Innovation \(PYSI\) project, funded by Innoviris \(Brussels-Capital Region\), to deepen this approach by exploring how interdisciplinarity can lead to a more complete understanding of international protection cases. We translated the lessons from this project into a practical guide on interdisciplinarity in international protection cases. The guide helps legal practitioners recognise the value of interdisciplinarity, work with experts from other fields, and integrate their insights in legal practice.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [10 461 0 R 12]
