/S /P
/P 140 0 R
/E (In 2025, NANSEN invested significant time in strengthening our direct cooperation with communities and community-based organisations. We provided training to beneficiaries of Pigment vzw, focusing on subsequent applications for international protection and providing practical guidance on how to navigate these complex procedures. NANSEN also collaborated with the Umbrella Refugee Committee, a platform led by, for and with forcibly displaced people, and several academic partners, to develop a concrete research project, highlighting the need for including the expertise of persons with lived experience in our activities and academic research. )
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [5 464 0 R 7]
>>
