/P 140 0 R
/E (NANSEN does not simply respond to the system as it is - we work to improve it. In 2025, this meant maintaining structural dialogue with the CGRS, sharing our findings, expertise and concrete recommendations, and taking part in the CGRS working group on vulnerability to help strengthen how vulnerability is understood and assessed. We also introduced our work directly to CGRS staff through a dedicated information session.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [8]
>>
