/Title (NANSEN always aims to address issues through structural dialogue first - but sometimes, when fundamental rights are at stake and dialogue is absent, a different kind of action is needed. Together with civil society partners, NANSEN contributes to strategic litigation when legislation introduces demonstrable barriers to the fundamental rights of people in need of international protection. In 2025, these efforts ranged from asylum procedures and the use of video conferencing to reception and return policy.)
